,"quote":"三年春二月〖3〗，以左、右御史大夫丁固、孟仁，为司徒、司空","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":379,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-d3c392cb7dbfc4cc0cfb","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-e4ef87bf1e9e271e47ea","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴录》曰：“仁字恭武。江夏人也。本名宗，避皓字，易焉。","attribution":"裴注（引书见引句）","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":424,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8254b7019ef4e8585836","start":3,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-e595567ff0f6dcb3c05d","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-e4ef87bf1e9e271e47ea","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴录》曰：“仁字恭武。江夏人也。本名宗，避皓字，易焉。","attribution":"裴注（引书未明）","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":424,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8254b7019ef4e8585836","start":3,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-fac5784524d225d8026f","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-fce5536b05cb3d0ea98d","layer":"original","quote":"黜亮为会稽王，时年十六","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":121,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-205b78ed83918590be53","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-995b1add40ee3ea39b31","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，遣守丞相孟仁、太常姚信等，备官僚、中军步骑二千人〖17〗，以灵舆、法驾〖18〗，东迎神于明陵。皓引见仁，亲拜送于庭。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-4ad8a428e1d1833140e0","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-4eb6fbc822bcae14383a","layer":"original","quote":"或有告綝怀怨侮上欲图反者，休执以付綝，綝杀之。由是愈惧，因孟宗，求出屯武昌。休许焉，尽敕所督中营精兵万余人〖24〗，皆令装载；所取武库兵器，咸令给与","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":486,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-f54cb1c723c263279556","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-2333ef50d9af09d52f56","layer":"original","quote":"使光禄勋孟宗，告庙废亮〖6〗，召群司议曰：“少帝荒病昏乱，不可以处大位，承宗庙；已告先帝，废之。诸君若有不同者，下异议〖7〗！”皆震怖，曰：“唯将军令！”綝遣中书郎李崇，夺亮玺绶，以亮罪状班告远近","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o118a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-f44f35cbbf842da3839b","layer":"original","quote":"丞相雍奏，从大辟。其后，吴令孟宗丧母奔赴〖34〗，已，而自拘于武昌，以听刑。陆逊陈其素行，因为之请；权乃减宗一等〖35〗，后不得以为比：因此遂绝。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":80,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o118","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-f44f35cbbf842da3839b","layer":"original","quote":"丞相雍奏，从大辟。其后，吴令孟宗丧母奔赴〖34〗，已，而自拘于武昌，以听刑。陆逊陈其素行，因为之请；权乃减宗一等〖35〗，后不得以为比：因此遂绝。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":80,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-561aa3213ff97085ae1d","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-139fef0974ff4bd2c7d6","layer":"pei","quote":"皓悖虐，固与陆凯、孟宗同心忧国","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0fc9542c4adb6310827d","start":244,"end":259,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-a7c835f82230b992cee9","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-139fef0974ff4bd2c7d6","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《会稽典录》曰：“览字孝连。八岁而孤，家又单微；清身立行，用意不苟。推财从弟，以义让称。仕郡至功曹，守始平长。为人精微洁净，门无杂宾。孙权深贵待之。未及擢用，会病卒；甚见痛惜，殊其门户。览子固，字子贱。本名密，避滕密，改作固。固在襁褓中，阚泽见而异之，曰：‘此儿后必致公辅。’固少丧父，独与母居；家贫守约，色养致敬。族弟孤弱，与同寒温。翻与固同僚书曰：‘丁子贱塞渊好德，堂构克举，野无遗薪。斯之为懿，其美优矣。令德之后，惟此君嘉耳！’历显位。孙休时固为左御史大夫。孙皓即位，迁司徒。皓悖虐，固与陆凯、孟宗同心忧国。年七十六卒。子弥，字钦远。仕晋，至梁州刺史。孙潭，光禄大夫。徐陵字元大。历三县长，所在著称。迁零陵太守。时朝廷俟以列卿之位。故翻书曰：‘元大受上卿之遇；叔向在晋，未若于今。’其见重如此。陵卒，僮客土田或见侵夺；骆统为陵家讼之，求与丁览、卜清等为比：权许焉。陵子平，字伯先。童龀知名，翻甚爱之，屡称叹焉。诸葛恪为丹杨太守，讨山越；以平威重思虑，可与效力，请平为丞。稍迁武昌左部督，倾心接物，士卒皆为尽力。初，平为恪从事，意甚薄；及恪辅政，待平益疏。恪被害，子建亡走，为平部曲所得；平使遣去，别为他军所获。平两妇归宗，敬奉情过乎厚。其行义敦笃，皆此类也。”","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0fc9542c4adb6310827d","start":0,"end":536,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
